---
layout: page.njk
permalink: /downloads/
title: Downloads
subtitle: Forms, guidelines and public documents.
---
{% if downloads.items.length %}
<ul class="plain-list link-list prose">
{%- for d in downloads.items %}<li><a href="{{ d.file }}">{{ d.title }}</a>{% if d.note %} <span>({{ d.note }})</span>{% endif %}</li>{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Documents will be posted here soon. For anything you need now, call <a href="tel:{{ site.nonEmergency | tel }}">{{ site.nonEmergency }}</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
